        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Oval Front Door Handleset, Weslock 0351/2100</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis oval-shaped handleset is made in traditional styling. The handle is slightly curved for a comfortable in-hand fit. It is available with 4 different inside trim choices with a dummy or a single cylinder function. It has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. This Traditionale Collection Oval Entry Handle is an ANSI grade 2 rated lock. The Oval Front Door Handleset features adjustable latches for doors thickness from 1-3/4 inches to 2 inches and will adjust to fit backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Available in polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis oval handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\"><b>Weslock Traditionale Collection</b></a> which features lifetime finish and mechanical warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditionale Collection Entry Oval Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI grade 2 lock.</li>\r\n<li>5-pin cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Zinc die-cast exterior, stamped brass interior.</li>\r\n<li>1\" throw deadbolt with 2 hardened steel rollers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited 10 year finish warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime PVD finish on exterior polished brass.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Weslock Traditionale Collection Oval Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>5-1/4\" minimum center to center cross hole spacing.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable from 1-3/4\" to 2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplate.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset does not function--neither locking nor latching.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the lever operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>* This item is discontinued. Use <a href=\"/products/oval-single-cylinder-lexington-handleset-weslock-2115-2100\"><b>Weslock Lexington Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/oval-lexington-dummy-handleset-weslock-2105-2104\"><b>Weslock Lexington Dummy  Handleset</b></a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
